      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00254",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“嗯。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00254",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "十六岁记的和今年记的最有意思。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The entries from when I was sixteen and the ones from this year are the most interesting.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00254",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "每次赴宴回来，换上睡衣就记。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Every time I came back from a party, I changed into my nightclothes and wrote in it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00254",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "不是回来得很晚吗，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I would come home very late, you know,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00254",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "每每写到一半就睡着了，有些地方现在还看得出来。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and I would often fall asleep halfway through writing; in some places you can still tell even now.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
